{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2021-07-26 03:00:00', 'title': 'CBOE EUROPE AND EUROCCP RECEIVE DUTCH REGULATORY APPROVALS FOR NEW EUROPEAN DERIVATIVES MARKET', 'text': 'LONDON, JULY 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CBOE EUROPE, THE PAN-EUROPEAN EXCHANGE OPERATOR AND SUBSIDIARY OF CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED THE NECESSARY REGULATORY APPROVALS TO LAUNCH CBOE EUROPE DERIVATIVES, A NEW AMSTERDAM-BASED FUTURES AND OPTIONS MARKET, ON 6\xa0SEPTEMBER, 2021. CBOE EUROPE B.V.'}